<title>CHINA: Trading in Cosmos Machinery suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Cosmos Machinery suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares in Cosmos Machinery Enterprises Ltd was suspended on Monday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of the machinery distributor and distilled water bottler were HK$0.475 higher to HK$2.80 at midday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
